938/9972/transcript_management_call/Earnings+Transcript+%28FY26+Q4%29.pdf","words":1140,"n_sentences":67,"year":"2026","s":["Good morning, everyone, and thanks for joining us.","Across markets, our teams continue to demonstrate the power of our omnichannel model.","Since the year began, I've visited great stores and clubs in the US, Canada, and Mexico.","We are gaining market share, and we have momentum in growth areas like marketplace, advertising, and membership.","Looking at our results for the quarter, revenue is up 4.9% in constant currency, including growth in eCommerce of 24%.","Adjusted operating income grew even faster at 10.5%.","Driving a healthier mix of sales growth in our business is important to the strategy overall.","Across our customer base, spending continues to be resilient.","That said, even these households are emphasizing convenience nearly as much as price.","Every dollar we spend has to compete for the highest return.","The investments we made in technology and supply chain help us deliver items even faster.","And being people-led and tech-powered helps our associates to find better ways to serve customers and members with our growing assortment, faster delivery speeds, and experiences they love.","We are enhancing our shopping assistants like Sparky and building new experiences with partners like OpenAI and Alphabet that are shaping the future of agentic commerce.","It connects digital intent to fulfillment through forward-deployed inventory and 1.5 million associates here in the US.","When Sparky builds a basket, we execute it through fast delivery, pickup, or in-store, turning AI engagement into immediate physical outcomes.","The idea of build one, scale globally makes us faster, lowers cost, and ensures consistency.","This platform-centric approach helps us scale innovation consistently and reduce capital intensity.","As I close, I will say the pace of change in retail is accelerating, it's exciting."],"x":[0,58,41,15,0,2,2,3,3,10,11,11,